<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 11, 2012<br/>Summer Update 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20041125161926&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Document_bed066.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a gnomish voucher type CA1.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.80 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It is a voucher for the first addon of the crystal warlord outfit.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Use it to obtain the first addon of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Warlord%20Outfits\">Crystal Warlord Outfits</a>.  The Ice Crystal Effect <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ice Crystal Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ice_Crystal_Effect_b9fe6f.gif\" width=\"96\"/></span></span> will appear on you. You cannot use it if you already possess this addon or you do not currently have Premium Time running.<br/>\nIt looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bill\">Bill</a>, a Document, a Document (Rewriteable), a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fan%20Club%20Membership%20Card\">Fan Club Membership Card</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Soul%20Contract\">Soul Contract</a> and all other Gnomish Vouchers.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-